5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure we build on the past, I wish to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and cross-unit standardization efforts.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think it would be... helpful to check the capital budget and software allowance. And maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Let's find something cool! I want to know about network coverage at customer plants and in-house developer availability. I bet there are mysteries there!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should focus on actual operational losses. I will look into the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Ryuji's focus on efficiency, but we must consider the human cost. I will investigate the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,A wise spread of interests. It seems we are covering both the financial and the human elements of our work.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, thank you... I just don't want us to be surprised by the costs later.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, don't be so worried! It'll be fine! I'm just excited to see what's happening at the plants!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Logic dictates that we identify the pain points before selecting a solution. I am satisfied with these choices.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Indeed. If we ignore the current workload of the staff, any new project will simply fail during implementation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
