60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Candidate A aligns with the need for standardization, but we must ensure the ""shared update procedures"" do not become a burden that leads to the tool being dropped.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Candidate A seems the most stable. If it's a hub, we might be able to manage the costs better than a per-user app like B or D.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Candidate D sounds cool, but remember the signal! Half the plants have no coverage! A hub like A is much safer because it's for the office!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Candidate A is the only logical choice. It directly solves the misrouted deliveries and the time lost to copying records by consolidating the data.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate A solves the vendor query redundancy and the coordination group's struggle. Candidate B would likely just create more ""summaries"" for people to read, adding to the workload.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,I agree. Candidate A provides a specific utility—a searchable catalog—which is more likely to survive than a general workflow assistant.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel comfortable with A. It addresses the problems without seeming to risk a huge, unexpected bill.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for A! It's like a big treasure map for all the supplier info! No more getting lost!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,The data is clear. The losses are in the records. Candidate A fixes the records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It is the most efficient use of resources and the most supportive of the current staff's capacity.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,It is rare to find such swift consensus. It shows we have listened to the needs of the floor and the lessons of the past.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm glad we all agree... it makes it much easier.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Yay! We solved the mystery of the missing data!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Logic has prevailed.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Efficiency has been prioritized.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
